ount": 0}, "text": "An AI agent broke into a government portal in June. Australia is now writing the law, and Paris tried to make the rules global. The weak point in both is the clock.\n\nOn Tuesday 10 November, Australia announced mandatory safety and security protections for every frontier AI", "url": "https://x.com/NewVirtuNom/status/2120403236548927777"}, {"article": {"title": "An OpenAI Agent Got Into a Medicare Portal. Now Australia Wants Mandatory Rules for Frontier AI."}, "author_id": "29310765", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:50:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318331894874136"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2120…", "end": 256, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120276339408207872", "start": 233, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120276339408207872", "url": "https://t.co/6l9AT74MjI"}]}, "id": "2120318331894874136", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Australia is drawing a line for frontier AI. 🇦🇺\n\nAfter the OpenAI Medicare portal incident, the government plans mandatory safety rules, rapid incident reporting and a new regulator. Here’s what’s proposed, and what isn’t law yet. 👇 https://t.co/6l9AT74MjI", "url": "https://x.com/DutchDollaz/status/2120318331894874136"}, {"author_id": "1769813347501776896", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120154512128110878"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/F4n5JiUBcn", "end": 311, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LogicUniv/status/2120154512128110878/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119873694029770752", "start": 288, "url": "https://t.co/F4n5JiUBcn"}]}, "id": "2120154512128110878", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 907, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 15}, "text": "🌍🤖 Countries Shaping International Rules on Artificial Intelligence\n\n🇺🇸 United States — AI safety, global standards &amp; frontier AI governance\n🇨🇳 China — AI regulation &amp; international governance proposals\n🇬🇧 United Kingdom — AI safety evaluations &amp; international cooperation\n🇫🇷 https://t.co/F4n5JiUBcn", "url": "https://x.com/LogicUniv/status/2120154512128110878"}, {"author_id": "369869874", "created_at": "2026-11-11T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120509347591561525"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 21, "start": 18, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 132, "start": 126, "tag": "India"}], "mentions": [{"end": 226, "id": "719200613", "start": 217, "username": "Rudra_81"}], "urls": [{"description": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "display_url": "or-f.org/40560", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://or-f.org/40560", "images": [{"height": 613, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118976800277594112/MwrS_O9j?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 871}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118976800277594112/MwrS_O9j?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 227, "status": 200, "title": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "unwound_url": "https://www.orfonline.org/research/india-must-urgently-build-its-own-ai-safety-institute", "url": "https://t.co/dKEyvqKWOF"}]}, "id": "2120509347591561525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The next phase of #AI competition will not only be about building powerful models, but also about governing them responsibly. #India needs an AI Safety Institute that can set benchmarks relevant for the Global South: @Rudra_81 https://t.co/dKEyvqKWOF", "url": "https://x.com/ORFMumbai/status/2120509347591561525"}, {"author_id": "2048275876887019520", "created_at": "2026-11-10T01:33:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119966540099727869"], "id": "2119966540099727869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "li